Name: dr_iris_kwan
Icon: I
Foreground: green_2
Description: Dr. Iris Kwan
LongDescription: Dr. Iris Kwan, Chief Biologist and Leader of the New World Program at Eschaton Biotech International (EBI). Once an idealistic ecologist, Dr. Kwan became disillusioned by humanity’s environmental destruction and turned to radical eugenics. She believes in creating a pure and sustainable humanity through strict genetic control, using bioengineering as a means to rebuild society according to her vision of perfection.
Dialogue: dr_iris_kwan
